Note on data and ontology

The TTL files of the Cibelex Knowledge Graph downloaded from Hugging Face
(MAIA-Madrid-IA/cibelex-graph-core-sampler) and the LoRO ontology bundled in
this image (ontology/loro.ttl) are released under their own license,
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0). See
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20076577 for the ontology deposit and the
Hugging Face dataset card for the graph license.
